# Server configuration is loaded from a TOML file (gateway settings only).
# Copy config/providers.example.toml -> config/providers.toml and adjust.
#
# Optional overrides:
# CONFIG_PATH=config/providers.toml   # path to the config file
#
# The server is a stateless proxy: each chat request carries the forwarding
# target (baseUrl / apiKey / api) in its body. Providers are stored in the
# browser (IndexedDB) by the settings UI, never on the server.
# Web search (Tavily) is the only server-side secret, configured in
# config/providers.toml — use search.api_key = "$TAVILY_API_KEY" to keep it
# out of the file.
